<title>USA: Chas Stewart Mott CC, Mich., to Betzold. [CORRECTED 20:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>Chas Stewart Mott CC, Mich., to Betzold. [CORRECTED 20:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Betzold Berg &amp; Nussbaum (corrects from Griffin Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson) said it won $6.025 million of Charles Stewart Mott Community College, Mich., general obligation building  and improvement bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.3337 percent (corrects from 5.329 percent).</p>
</text>
